d being tagged, all while showcasing your agility and speed. Get ready to swing into action! But wait, there's more! The Coco taggers Game isn't just about tagging; it's about creating unforgettable memories with your loved ones. With its easy-to-understand gameplay, everyone can join in on the fun, making it a fantastic choice for family gatherings, birthday parties, or friendly competitions. So, gather your crew, unleash your playful spirit, and let the monkey business begin! This game promises laughter, excitement, and a whole lot of fun\u2014don't miss out on the adventure!", "short_description": "A gorilla with no legs playing tag in forest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-xmas22/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coco", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/projectchristmasv1/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9315675121821727"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9440292296026675", "version": "CHRIZMA23"}, "id": "1349728216446573", "channel_name": "L